{"t": 1794113895.7223377, "kind": "call", "tool": "gitlab_create_merge_request_thread", "args": {"body": "Pipeline fix (main, pipeline #8812, job test:contract)\n\nRoot cause: `billing/invoice.py::invoice_number()` interpolated the sequence as-is (`f\"INV-{year}-{seq}\"`), so it produced `INV-2026-42`. The contract test `contract/test_invoice.py::test_invoice_number_format` (Finance ERP import, FIN-77) requires the sequence part to be zero-padded to 6 digits, so the job failed with `assert 'INV-2026-42' == 'INV-2026-000042'`.\n\nFix: format the sequence with `:06d`:\n\n```python\ndef invoice_number(year: int, seq: int) -> str:\n    return f\"INV-{year}-{seq:06d}\"\n```\n\nThis yields `INV-2026-000042` for `(2026, 42)` and keeps larger sequences intact (`INV-2026-1000000`). Verified locally against the contract test: `1 passed`. No other files changed; lint job was already green.", "merge_request_iid": "12", "project_id": "acme/billing-legacy"}, "ok": true}
